<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="emblems">Emblems of Conquest for Blood Death Knight Tanks in Phase 2</h3>Emblems of Conquest become the new raid currency, replacing Emblem of Valor. These work the exact same way, allowing you to buy pieces of gear close to the ilvl of the raid drops. First and foremost you'll want to pick up both of your tier pieces, as these are your bis for their slot. From there it's really up to whatever you need the most. <br/>
<br/>It's also worth noting that you can buy Runed Orbs, which are used to craft BoE's, and will likely cost a lot the first couple of weeks. With the crafted belt being our BIS defensive option, and the boots being a solid upgrade over T7 boots until you can get some Ulduar drops, these are actually quite valuable. <br/>
